  "description": "The Smok TFV9 vape tank is the latest sub ohm tank to join the very best of Smok’s TFV range. The 2ml tank is made from hard-wearing stainless steel and pyrex glass and features adjustable airflow for unparalleled customisability. The TFV9 can be easily refilled by releasing the push to fill top cap and filling the tank through the exposed refill port for a clean, mess-free experience. Its 510 connector makes the tank compatible with most powerful mods. Compatible with either Smok TFV9 mesh coils 0.15ohm or the V8 Baby 0.15ohm mesh coils, whichever coil you use, the TFV9 delivers the most incredible flavour and immense clouds to satisfy every sub-ohm, high-VG eliquid fan.",
